1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,900
Thank goodness, Nezuko's asleep.

2
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,980
Nezuko! No, don't!

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:48,100
You sleep tight, Nezuko.

4
00:00:48,100 --> 00:01:09,340
I can still move, I can still put up a fight, and this time, no matter what happens, I'm fighting

5
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:10,340
to the very end!

6
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:25,100
Nezuko! No, don't!

7
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:28,100
Nezuko! No, don't!

8
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:33,100
Nezuko! No, don't!

9
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:39,100
But that's the end of the day, I'm just there.

10
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:45,100
I'm going to be the same, I'm going to be the same, and this time, no matter what happens, I'm going to be the same.

11
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:50,100
Here you go!

12
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:54,900
光も闇も怒りも全部抱きしめて

13
00:01:54,900 --> 00:02:00,600
選ばれなければ選べばいい

14
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:04,000
声を枯らして燃える花の花に

15
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,900
波を照らしたら

16
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:11,800
曖昧すぎる世界を想いにして

17
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:15,200
夜を数えて朝を描くような

18
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:18,200
鮮やかな目を鳴らす

19
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:20,700
どんなに深い後悔も

20
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:23,700
どんなに高い限界も

21
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:25,700
かき消して

22
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:26,700
残響

23
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:54,700
ご視聴ありがとうございました

24
00:02:54,700 --> 00:03:01,200
ご視聴ありがとうございました

25
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:07,700
ご視聴ありがとうございました

26
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:20,200
ご視聴ありがとうございました

27
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:25,700
ご視聴ありがとうございました

28
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:28,200
ご視聴ありがとうございました

29
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:30,200
ご視聴ありがとうございました

30
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:32,700
ご視聴ありがとうございました

31
00:03:32,700 --> 00:03:36,200
ご視聴ありがとうございました

32
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:39,200
ご視聴ありがとうございました

33
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:42,200
ご視聴ありがとうございました

34
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:47,200
ご視聴ありがとうございました

35
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:54,700
You have no idea. This country of ours. It's giant. It's full of people who would blow your mind.

36
00:03:55,620 --> 00:04:00,780
Some are a complete mystery. They can pick up a sword and become a Hashiro in just two months.

37
00:04:02,140 --> 00:04:05,220
Yet you're saying I'm special? What a load of crap!

38
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:09,980
Do you have any idea just how many lives have slipped through my fingers?

39
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:15,000
That's right. Rengoku is always ahead of me in that regard.

40
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:24,220
Meh. If you aren't special, then what's going on? Both of my bloodsicles are drenched with deadly poison.

41
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:28,440
I'm positive it's entered your bloodstream by now, so why aren't you dead?

42
00:04:29,260 --> 00:04:34,220
I said I'm a trained shinobi, didn't I? I'm immune to nearly all types of poison.

43
00:04:34,220 --> 00:04:39,740
The shinobi were wiped out back during the Edo period, you fool. Don't think you can lie to us.

44
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,880
It's not a lie.

45
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:46,500
The shinobi still exists. I had nine brothers and sisters.

46
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:49,740
Seven died by the time I turned 15.

47
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:56,540
Frightened that our clan would live on only in history, my father forced us to train as if our lives depended on it.

48
00:04:57,720 --> 00:05:02,300
The only survivors were myself and my brother two years younger than me.

49
00:05:03,020 --> 00:05:04,980
And he was exactly like my father.

50
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:08,980
They shared the same mindset, treating subordinates like pawns.

51
00:05:08,980 --> 00:05:16,560
His wives were no exception. He just wanted heirs. No one else ever had any say. His word was absolute.

52
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:22,400
And I... I didn't want to become like him.

53
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:30,860
It's hard, isn't it, Tengen? The path that you've chosen.

54
00:05:30,860 --> 00:05:39,720
You've decided to reject the very same values that shaped you into the shinobi you are today.

55
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:42,920
And enter the battlefield where those values thrive.

56
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:44,380
It must be painful.

57
00:05:44,380 --> 00:05:53,800
Despite carrying all that conflict within yourself, still, you all insist on pushing forward and fighting.

58
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:56,040
And for a noble cause, too.

59
00:05:57,180 --> 00:05:59,580
All so you can protect other people's lives.

60
00:05:59,580 --> 00:06:05,480
You have my thanks.

61
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:08,040
You are quite a remarkable child.

62
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:13,420
It is I who should be giving thanks.

63
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:19,800
Master, I'd never think twice about laying down my life for your sake.

64
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:25,960
Those with conflict might be spineless fools, but it's why I've achieved everything that I have up until now.

65
00:06:26,740 --> 00:06:28,340
And I've never been without it.

66
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:40,900
What the hell are you laughing about?

67
00:06:41,580 --> 00:06:43,100
Slowly but surely.

68
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:46,240
The poison's affecting you after all, isn't it?

69
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:51,920
This must be embarrassing after all that talk about it not working on a guy like you, huh?

70
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,660
You're wrong.

71
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:57,620
I'm fine.

72
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,660
Look for yourself.

73
00:06:58,660 --> 00:07:00,540
I've never felt better.

74
00:07:00,780 --> 00:07:03,360
I could devour a hundred bowls of Tempura Dawn.

75
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,140
In a flashy way, of course.

76
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:17,240
Don't you dare lay a hand on my little sister!

77
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,620
You scumbag!

78
00:07:18,620 --> 00:07:29,220
Well, those are unique explosions.

79
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:32,180
They can inflict damage on a demon's body.

80
00:07:32,180 --> 00:07:34,620
And detonate from the slightest friction.

81
00:07:35,500 --> 00:07:38,380
Since she slashed one without realizing that, she got hit.

82
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:42,500
There's never a dull moment taking care of her, that's for sure.

83
00:07:42,500 --> 00:07:52,200
No, he's holding on to the tip of his sword.

84
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:53,900
What kind of insane grip is that?

85
00:07:53,900 --> 00:07:54,480
Now!

86
00:07:54,480 --> 00:08:03,960
I missed my chance to finish him!

87
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:08,140
He just beheaded me again!

88
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,220
Damn you!

89
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:10,420
Damn you!

90
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:12,500
I'll make you pay for this!

91
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:14,600
It's not fair!

92
00:08:14,860 --> 00:08:15,780
Not fair!

93
00:08:15,780 --> 00:08:18,680
How come I'm the one who's always getting beheaded!

94
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:23,560
Hold on.

95
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:25,980
You're on to us, aren't you, big guy?

96
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:27,960
About what?

97
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:33,740
Not that finding out about our little trick will do you any good, since you're going to

98
00:08:33,740 --> 00:08:35,920
die a slow and painful death anyway.

99
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:42,300
Even now, as we speak, we're getting closer and closer to your inevitable death, aren't

100
00:08:42,300 --> 00:08:42,760
we?

101
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:45,840
Are you sure about that?

102
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,320
Who did you forget about me?

103
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:50,500
It is I, Lordy Nostate!

104
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:52,340
Along with my trusty minion!

105
00:08:52,340 --> 00:09:00,220
Who the hell are these two idiots?

106
00:09:22,340 --> 00:09:40,000
Follow me if you're wounded!

107
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:41,760
That's for everyone else!

108
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,600
Please evacuate!

109
00:09:52,340 --> 00:10:03,600
I've taught you well!

110
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:06,060
Talk about a flashy entrance!

111
00:10:06,780 --> 00:10:07,700
Keep it coming!

112
00:10:07,700 --> 00:10:27,900
You can summon all the underlings you want, but unfortunately your fate was sealed from the start.

113
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:35,100
So look, you are all going to die anyway, right?

114
00:10:35,100 --> 00:10:38,880
So drop the act and quit staring at me like that, will ya?

115
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:41,320
There are two demons now.

116
00:10:42,180 --> 00:10:43,480
How did that happen?

117
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:47,340
Also, the belt demon isn't dead.

118
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:51,860
Are they both upper six and somehow splintered off each other?

119
00:10:53,380 --> 00:10:58,120
If that is the case, then there's no doubt this guy is the main threat.

120
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,520
His scent is different.

121
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,000
It's far stronger.

122
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:07,280
It feels like the back of my throat's going numb from it.

123
00:11:09,860 --> 00:11:11,780
My hands won't stop shaking.

124
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,520
Is it because I'm exhausted?

125
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:16,580
Or is it that I'm afraid?

126
00:11:17,500 --> 00:11:18,740
It doesn't matter.

127
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:20,580
Because either way,

128
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:23,360
no matter how strong they are,

129
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:24,600
we'll win!

130
00:11:24,820 --> 00:11:26,640
Cause we're Demon Slayer Corps!

131
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:29,040
Yeah right, that chance!

132
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:32,840
Not when your only hope to win is being ravaged by poison!

133
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:34,800
Poison?

134
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:38,540
Does it look like I care, you idiots?

135
00:11:38,980 --> 00:11:42,220
I'm at the top of my game when I got a little poison in my system!

136
00:11:42,780 --> 00:11:44,160
Drop the act already!

137
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,460
It's no act!

138
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:47,140
You just underestimate humans!

139
00:11:47,700 --> 00:11:50,100
All three of these boys are my brilliant Tsukuko!

140
00:11:50,620 --> 00:11:52,420
They have relentless grit!

141
00:11:52,700 --> 00:11:54,660
Yeah, we do!

142
00:11:54,820 --> 00:11:57,260
And they'll fight even if their limbs fall off!

143
00:11:57,760 --> 00:12:01,300
Not to mention, I've already figured out how to bring you two down!

144
00:12:01,300 --> 00:12:05,580
And that's to behead the both of you!

145
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,840
Simultaneously!

146
00:12:07,340 --> 00:12:08,040
Am I right?

147
00:12:16,580 --> 00:12:19,640
That's why you don't just absorb your weaker sister completely!

148
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:22,280
Keeping your talents separate makes you harder to kill!

149
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:23,660
Ha ha!

150
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,520
This'll be easy peasy!

151
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:26,620
Ha ha ha!

152
00:12:26,940 --> 00:12:28,660
That's as simple as that, isn't it?

153
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:31,120
Then we've already won, haven't we?

154
00:12:31,820 --> 00:12:37,340
You say that, but the demon slayers who perished before you didn't find that task to be so simple!

155
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:39,340
Not even the Hashira!

156
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:42,460
Fifteen for me and seven for my sister!

157
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:44,980
That's how many we've devoured!

158
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:46,480
You heard him!

159
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:49,780
Not a single one of those fools even lived to see Daybreak!

160
00:12:52,020 --> 00:12:55,920
After all, we always have the long nights on our side!

161
00:12:56,340 --> 00:12:59,080
Your deaths are inevitable, so just die!

162
00:12:59,760 --> 00:12:59,960
Huh?

163
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:00,800
WILL HE QUired?

164
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:16,040
Sanitsu, leave that whirlady to me and Mr. Sleepyhead!

165
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:19,560
You two focus on taking down the praying mantis looking guy!

166
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:21,600
Careful! Yeah, yeah!

167
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:25,600
I'm not about to let you kill my sister.

168
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,700
It's you! The little brat!

169
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:34,440
There's something I need to tell you.

170
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:38,740
Apologize to the girl whose ear you pulled.

171
00:13:39,620 --> 00:13:39,840
Huh?

172
00:13:41,220 --> 00:13:46,480
Even if it really was your earnings that kept the house afloat and provided for everyone,

173
00:13:46,480 --> 00:13:49,560
it still doesn't make those girls your belongings.

174
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:53,180
You have no right to treat them like that.

175
00:13:54,300 --> 00:13:57,200
Oh, please, don't bore me with your high and mighty lecturing.

176
00:13:57,940 --> 00:14:02,440
With unfortunate looks like yours, what makes you think that you can talk down to me exactly?

177
00:14:03,540 --> 00:14:07,360
In this city, women are merchandise, the same as objects.

178
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,860
They are bought, sold, and then discarded.

179
00:14:12,180 --> 00:14:13,840
Such is the right of an owner.

180
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:17,380
Those without beauty don't deserve even a grain of rice.

181
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:21,260
It only makes sense the wretches shouldn't be treated as humans.

182
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:28,380
You shouldn't inflict the pain that was done to you onto others.

183
00:14:29,060 --> 00:14:30,900
You couldn't be more wrong.

184
00:14:30,900 --> 00:14:34,060
The horrible things done to us.

185
00:14:34,460 --> 00:14:35,920
The things that made us suffer.

186
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:39,380
It only makes sense to give back what we received.

187
00:14:40,220 --> 00:14:42,120
We might have been driven to misfortune,

188
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:46,020
but we make up for it in the revenge we exact upon the blessed.

189
00:14:46,020 --> 00:14:50,440
Do you understand now?

190
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:53,400
That's the way we've chosen to live our lives.

191
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:56,880
We have killed off anyone who's ever crossed us.

192
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:59,240
Anyone who's ever slighted us.

193
00:14:59,860 --> 00:15:02,580
We're going to slash through your gullets,

194
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:05,800
just like we did to all who came before you.

195
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:10,460
His bloodlust is unreal.

196
00:15:10,940 --> 00:15:12,500
It's giving my whole body chills.

197
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:14,620
He's the real deal.

198
00:15:15,020 --> 00:15:16,080
An upper six demon.

199
00:15:16,660 --> 00:15:17,800
You have to focus.

200
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:21,160
Mr. Uzui's been poisoned, so I have to protect him.

201
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:24,960
Strike with your sword the instant he makes a move.

202
00:15:25,700 --> 00:15:27,320
The second he moves even an inch.

203
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:28,620
That's my chance.

204
00:15:29,980 --> 00:15:30,620
Swing it.

205
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:31,660
Swing your sword.

206
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:32,520
Evade it.

207
00:15:32,860 --> 00:15:33,460
Evade it.

208
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:34,660
Bend backwards.

209
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:35,360
Bend.

210
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:45,660
What are you doing?

211
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:48,880
He protected you instead, and now you're just a hindrance.

212
00:15:58,320 --> 00:16:00,480
I can't deflect this many belts.

213
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:11,080
She's got three eyes.

214
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:15,460
I can see everything now, including all of your movements.

215
00:16:15,460 --> 00:16:20,580
Now that brother's awake, I'm able to show you what my true power looks like.

216
00:16:21,340 --> 00:16:22,180
Shut up!

217
00:16:22,380 --> 00:16:24,820
Your shrill voice is really making my head hurt.

218
00:16:24,820 --> 00:16:36,620
Then here I thought you'd be different.

219
00:16:36,620 --> 00:16:43,780
You won't get close enough to even start fighting me!

220
00:16:43,780 --> 00:16:45,660
Shut up, war ladies!

221
00:16:45,660 --> 00:16:50,640
If you're really as strong as you say, then why run your belt the whole time instead of killing us?

222
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:54,320
Be careful what you ask for!

223
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:54,360
Be careful what you ask for!

224
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:54,960
I'll be careful.

225
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:58,960
I'll be careful!

226
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:00,440
I'll be careful what you ask.

227
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:01,000
Oh, oh, oh.

228
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:01,460
Ah!

229
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:05,920
Ah ah ah ah!

230
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:06,540
Ah!

231
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:06,840
Ah ah!

232
00:17:09,180 --> 00:17:10,300
Ah ah ah ah!

233
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:13,800
Ah ah ah ah ah

234
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:14,400
Ach!

235
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:14,680
Ah!

236
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,620
Ah ah ah ah ah ah ah uh.

237
00:17:15,620 --> 00:17:17,080
Ah ah.

238
00:17:17,080 --> 00:17:22,080
This speed! He really is like a praying mantis! And these attacks of his!

239
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,080
I'm trapped!

240
00:17:41,080 --> 00:17:46,080
Why are these slashes so heavy?

241
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:51,080
Sidestep it! Ward off the blow!

242
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:54,080
If you take it head on, it'll snap your blade in half!

243
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:59,080
If it's power versus power, the weaker side always loses!

244
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:03,080
Don't misjudge the flow of power and redirect it as necessary!

245
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:06,080
The flexible water breathing technique is better for defense!

246
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:12,080
If I had just done this before, my blade never would have gotten chipped!

247
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:23,080
Sound breathing. Fifth form.

248
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:27,080
Straight performance!

249
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:34,080
You can use your noisy moves all you want, Hashira, but it changes nothing!

250
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:38,080
Drop dead, you ugly tomes!

251
00:18:41,080 --> 00:18:44,080
Now we have blood blades flying towards us with the belt?

252
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:48,080
If this keeps up, then I'll never be able to get near the worm lady!

253
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:51,080
These damn blood blades are bad news!

254
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:54,080
